!.env.example
# Keep local task history and review artifacts out of the public source repository.
/CLAUDE.md
/docs/*
!/docs/release/
/docs/release/*
!/docs/release/SUPPORT.md
!/docs/release/SUPPORT.en.md
!/docs/release/CHANGELOG.md
!/docs/release/CHANGELOG.en.md
!/docs/release/PRIVACY.md
# Pages HTML is generated by GitHub Actions from the tracked sources.
/assets/sounds/*
!/assets/sounds/README.md
# Screen recordings (e.g. App Review demo videos) are large local files, not source.
*.mp4
*.MP4
*.mov
*.MOV
*.m4v
